The ftetest fixture -- original test content for the FTEQW arm64 fork
======================================================================

Copyright (C) 2026 Kat Aurelia and the fteqw-upstream contributors.

This fixture (the QuakeC sources under src/, the map source maps/ftetest.map,
the BSP generator tools/gen_bsp.py, the generated maps/ftetest.bsp and progs.dat,
and the generated model/sprite/sound assets) is original authorship created for
the purpose of exercising the FTEQW engine in an automated test suite.

It contains NO id Software game data of any kind. It is licensed under the
GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (GPL-2.0-or-later), matching the
rest of this repository. See ../../LICENSE for the full text.

The Quake progs<->engine ABI reflected in src/defs.qc (global/field names and
ordering, standard builtin numbers) is a functional interface, not a creative
work; the reference implementation is FTE's own GPL basemod (quakec/basemod/).
